Error [E0068]: This callable uses the retired result-arrow shape.
  --> tests/ui/E0927_unknown_marker_function.jet:6:16
    |
  6 | fn hot(a: Int) => Int {
    |                ^^
 Why: a return type sits after the parameter list, and `->` introduces the body; an effect ceiling follows the return type
 Fix: write `fn name(...) Type -> body`, or `fn name(...) Type -[Effects]> { … }`

Error [E0927]: `#Inlin` isn't a known applied rule
  --> tests/ui/E0927_unknown_marker_function.jet:5:2
    |
  5 | #Inlin
    |  ^^^^^
 Why: `Inlin` isn't registered as an applied rule — Jet rules are a closed, registered vocabulary (I7), not any PascalCase word.
 Fix: did you mean `#Inline`?
